= Brexit and the Populist Wave

British voters have chosen to leave the European Union, and populist movements across the West are riding a wave of anger at globalization and elites. Many ask whether the same wave is coming for America.

- @brexit_econ: Sharpen our economic message
- @brexit_warn: Warn of the dangers of nationalism

@brexit_econ
on-arrival: working_dem += 3*(1-dissent); rural_dem += 1*(1-dissent); populist_strength += 2; crisis_urgency += 1

We stress wages, jobs, and community, and take the anger seriously.

@brexit_warn
on-arrival: trump_urgency += 1; suburban_dem += 2*(1-dissent); educated_dem += 1*(1-dissent); rural_dem -= 1*(1-dissent)

We warn that economic anxiety is being exploited.
